  </order>
  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>Staging audit: total_rows_count = raw_* count, success_rows_count = stg_* count (clean rows), failed_rows_count = raw - stg.
etl_extraction_control.rows_extracted = success_rows_count (accepted rows).
started_at comes from ETL_STARTED_AT JVM variable (set by 00_start_etl_source_to_staging).
LSET/CET watermark update pattern:
  lset_value = old CET (read from JVM variable CET_{SOURCE_NAME} set by 00_start)
  cet_value  = MAX(raw_loaded_at) from SQL query
  => After this run: lset = old cet, cet = new max raw_loaded_at
Incremental load in future: load pipelines use LSET_*/CET_* JVM vars to filter source records.</note>
